      "description": "<h3>Updated to 1.0.6!</h3>\n<p>Final version for now, enjoy this as I take a long break.</p>\n<h1>NEW STICKERS!</h1>\n<p>Female Black Division Operative, USEC Female Operative, a BEAR Female Operative and a female Scav Sniper.</p>\n<p>Added Tactical Operatives of Female Operators varying gear and weaponry.</p>\n<h1>MOORE HORSE GIRLS!!!!!!!!</h1>\n<p>Added More Gold Ship stickers. Added a Agnes Tachyon Sticker with a soldier and an Altyn, which totals up to;</p>\n<h3>40 UMAMUSUME STICKERS IN THIS ADDON.</h3>\n<p>bro.</p>\n<p>Added 7 stickers, ranging of FOG Stickers, Morale and straight up larp stickers.</p>\n<p>Added a Kalshi bet that you can put on your gun that decides whether you will decide on living or dying in the raid.</p>\n<p>Added a Cag Maxwell the cat.</p>\n",
